      "topic_id": "bounds_calculation",
      "prompt": "A car travels 204 km (to the nearest km) in 8 hours (to the nearest hour). Calculate the upper bound for the average speed of the car, to 1 decimal place.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Distance: 204 km (to the nearest km) gives 203.5 ≤ distance < 204.5",
        "Time: 8 hours (to the nearest hour) gives 7.5 ≤ time < 8.5",
